# pm-copilot web — frontend environment configuration.
#
# Used at build time by Vite. Copy to .env.local during dev (gitignored).
#
# In the cf-azure deploy, frontend lives on Cloudflare Pages and backend
# lives on Azure Container Apps as separate services. The frontend needs
# to know the backend URL to make cross-origin /api/* calls.

# Backend API base URL. Leave UNSET in dev to use the Vite proxy
# (vite.config.ts already proxies /api -> http://localhost:8787).
# Set in production (Cloudflare Pages dashboard) to the Azure host.
#
# Examples:
#   VITE_API_BASE=https://pm-copilot-api.eastus.azurecontainerapps.io
#   VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:8787   (when running `docker run` of the backend)
# VITE_API_BASE=
